<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1d1d1c" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="J先生个人空间的实用工具集合，按生活、AI 与运动分类。"
    />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/officialwebsite/favicon.png" />
    <title>实用工具｜J先生的个人空间</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --bg: #1d1d1c;
        --panel: #252524;
        --panel-strong: #2c2c2b;
        --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
        --ink: #f4f4f3;
        --muted: #a5a5a0;
        --blue: #7f96ff;
        --pink: #ff5d98;
        --font: "Manrope", "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html {
        min-width: 320px;
        min-height: 100%;
        background: var(--bg);
      }
      body {
        min-width: 320px;
        min-height: 100svh;
        margin: 0;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        background: radial-gradient(
            ellipse 70% 55% at 96% 0%,
            rgba(75, 89, 146, 0.22),
            transparent 68%
          ),
          radial-gradient(
            ellipse 52% 48% at 6% 100%,
            rgba(169, 55, 109, 0.2),
            transparent 72%
          ),
          var(--bg);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font);
        text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .shell {
        width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 48px));
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 22px 0 78px;
      }
      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
      .brand {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .brand svg {
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
      }
      .home-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: color 180ms ease;
      }
      .home-link:hover {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .hero {
        padding: clamp(80px, 13vw, 150px) 0 clamp(50px, 7vw, 82px);
      }
      .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 18px;
        color: var(--blue);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 102px);
        letter-spacing: -0.065em;
        line-height: 0.92;
      }
      .hero-copy {
        max-width: 520px;
        margin: 28px 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .catalog {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .category {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 180px minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 38px;
        padding: 34px 0 40px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .category-title {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .category-index {
        color: #73736f;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      }
      h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      }
      .tools-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
      }
      .tool-card {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        min-height: 178px;
        grid-template-columns: 52px 1fr auto;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 27px;
        background: rgba(37, 37, 36, 0.88);
        transition:
          border-color 220ms ease,
          transform 220ms ease,
          background 220ms ease;
      }
      .tool-card::before {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        opacity: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(
          circle at 5% 100%,
          rgba(255, 93, 152, 0.16),
          transparent 44%
        );
        content: "";
        transition: opacity 220ms ease;
      }
      .tool-card:hover {
        border-color: rgba(127, 150, 255, 0.42);
        background: var(--panel-strong);
        transform: translateY(-3px);
      }
      .tool-card:hover::before {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      .tool-icon {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        place-items: center;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: #20201f;
      }
      .tool-icon svg {
        width: 27px;
        fill: none;
        stroke: #f4f4f3;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
        stroke-width: 1.8;
      }
      .tool-copy {
        position: relative;
      }
      .tool-copy h3 {
        margin: 0 0 9px;
        font-size: 23px;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      }
      .tool-copy p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
      .tool-meta {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .tag {
        border: 1px solid rgba(127, 150, 255, 0.3);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 6px 9px;
        color: #aebcff;
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .arrow {
        color: #d8d8d4;
        font-size: 21px;
      }
      .empty-card {
        min-height: 126px;
        border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 28px;
        color: #767672;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .empty-card strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 7px;
        color: #9a9a95;
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .shell {
          width: min(100% - 28px, 560px);
          padding-top: 15px;
        }
        .brand span {
          font-size: 14px;
        }
        .hero {
          padding: 82px 0 54px;
        }
        .hero-copy {
          font-size: 14px;
        }
        .category {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 22px;
          padding: 28px 0 32px;
        }
        .tools-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .tool-card {
          min-height: 150px;
          grid-template-columns: 46px 1fr;
          gap: 16px;
          padding: 22px 18px;
        }
        .tool-icon {
          width: 46px;
          height: 46px;
          border-radius: 14px;
        }
        .tool-meta {
          grid-column: 2;
          justify-content: space-between;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
          transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="shell">
      <nav class="topbar" aria-label="页面导航">
        <a class="brand" href="/officialwebsite/" aria-label="返回个人空间首页">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs
              ><linearGradient
                id="logo-gradient"
                x1="0.12"
                y1="0.98"
                x2="0.85"
                y2="0.08"
                ><stop offset="0" stop-color="#6887ff"></stop><stop
                  offset="0.34"
                  stop-color="#a961ff"></stop><stop
                  offset="0.61"
                  stop-color="#ff3868"></stop><stop
                  offset="1"
                  stop-color="#ff7200"></stop></linearGradient
              ></defs
            >
            <path
              fill="url(#logo-gradient)"
              d="M0 64V22C0 9.85 9.85 0 22 0s22 9.85 22 22v3h2c9.94 0 18 8.06 18 18s-8.06 18-18 18H21.5C13.9 61 6.56 62.04 0 64Z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <span>J先生的个人空间</span>
        </a>
        <a class="home-link" href="/officialwebsite/"
          >首页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </nav>

      <header class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">UTILITY SHELF · 08</p>
        <h1>实用工具</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          把真正会反复使用的小工具放在一起。少一点跳转，多一点一眼就能看懂的结果。
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="catalog">
        <section class="category" aria-labelledby="life-title">
          <div class="category-title">
            <span class="category-index">01</span><h2 id="life-title">生活</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="tools-grid">
            <a class="tool-card" href="/officialwebsite/tools/appointment/">
              <span class="tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"
                  ><rect x="5" y="7" width="22" height="20" rx="4"></rect><path
                    d="M10 4v6M22 4v6M5 13h22M11 20h10M16 15v10"></path></svg
                >
              </span>
              <span class="tool-copy"
                ><h3>挂号</h3><p>
                  华山、瑞金专家号源一屏总览，含上午/下午状态与放号提醒。
                </p></span
              >
              <span class="tool-meta"
                ><span class="tag">真实号源</span><span
                  class="arrow"
                  aria-hidden="true">↗</span
                ></span
              >
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="category" aria-labelledby="ai-title">
          <div class="category-title">
            <span class="category-index">02</span><h2 id="ai-title">AI</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="tools-grid">
            <a
              class="tool-card"
              href="https://www.magicj.cn/officialwebsite/topics/tools/skills-mcp/skills-mcp-directory"
            >
              <span class="tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32">
                  <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3"></circle>
                  <circle cx="24" cy="8" r="3"></circle>
                  <circle cx="16" cy="24" r="3"></circle>
                  <path d="M10.5 9.5 14 21M21.5 9.5 18 21M11 8h10"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="tool-copy">
                <h3>Skills / MCP大全</h3>
                <p>
                  集中查找常用 Skills 与 MCP
                  工具，快速了解能力、用途和适用场景。
                </p>
              </span>
              <span class="tool-meta"
                ><span class="tag">AI 工具</span><span
                  class="arrow"
                  aria-hidden="true">↗</span
                ></span
              >
            </a>
            <a
              class="tool-card"
              href="https://www.magicj.cn/officialwebsite/topics/knowledge/terms?group=ai-llm"
            >
              <span class="tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32">
                  <path
                    d="M7 6.5h8.5A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 20 11v15H11.5A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 7 30.5v-24Z"
                  ></path>
                  <path
                    d="M20 11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 4.5-4.5H27v20h-2.5A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 20 31"
                  ></path>
                  <path d="M11 13h5M11 18h5"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="tool-copy">
                <h3>AI术语大全</h3>
                <p>
                  集中查阅 AI 与大模型常用术语，快速理解核心概念和技术表达。
                </p>
              </span>
              <span class="tool-meta"
                ><span class="tag">AI 知识</span><span
                  class="arrow"
                  aria-hidden="true">↗</span
                ></span
              >
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="category" aria-labelledby="sport-title">
          <div class="category-title">
            <span class="category-index">03</span><h2 id="sport-title">运动</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="empty-card">
            <strong>运动工具正在候场</strong
            >后续可从训练记录、跑步计划或恢复提醒中选择最常用的一项加入。
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
